# Go Version Policy

The project MUST use Go 1.26.x.

Rules:

1. Never use Go versions older than 1.26.
2. Never change `go.mod` to an older Go version.
3. Use Go 1.26-compatible standard library APIs.
4. Verify `go version` before major Go implementation changes.
5. Keep Docker images on Go 1.26.x.
6. Keep CI/CD Go versions aligned with Go 1.26.x.
7. If a dependency requires a different Go version, stop and report the conflict.
8. Do not silently downgrade Go to resolve dependency issues.